==== FillFromTapSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the sound that will be played when tap water is poured into an item.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
FillFromTapSound = GetWaterFromTapPlasticBig,
</syntaxhighlight>
